  m_text: "CREDITS\r\n\r\n<YummyDrawer> - TEAM Supersolver\r\n\u2022 \uAE40\uC6A9\uC624
    | PM / Programmer\r\n\u2022 \uBBFC\uB3D9\uCC2C | Contents Programmer / Level
