    | Outgame Programmer / Sound\r\n\r\n<Assets>\r\n\u2022 Layer Lab (GUI Pro-CasualGame
    / FantasyHero / BlueSky / TheStone)\r\n\u2022 Tycoon_GUIPack\r\n\u2022 UniTask\r\n\u2022
    Demigiant DOTween\r\n\u2022 CrystalFramework(SafeArea.cs)\r\n\u2022 Firebase\r\n\r\n<SPECIAL
    THANKS>\r\n\u2022 Linkz \uC774\uBD80\uD604\r\n\u2022 \uB514\uBCA8\uB85C\uCF13
